    <mediaPropertyAltText>
      <Value><![CDATA[A river curving past a stone arched bridge towards a tall pinnacled Gothic-revival building and old gabled houses under a cloud-filled sky.]]></Value>
    </mediaPropertyAltText>
    <mediaPropertyCountry>
      <Value><![CDATA[[
  "Belgium"
]]]></Value>
    </mediaPropertyCountry>
    <mediaPropertyDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[The Leie riverfront in Ghent by St Michael's Bridge. NOTE: the prominent spired building is the old Post Office, not St Bavo's Cathedral — the filename's 'St Bavos' is misleading.]]></Value>
